<title>JAPAN: Japan airliner hijacked on domestic flight - NHK TV.</title>
<headline>Japan airliner hijacked on domestic flight - NHK TV.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>An All Nippon Airways passenger aircraft was hijacked on Monday on a domestic flight from Osaka to Fukuoka in southern Japan, NHK television said.  </p>
<p>The television report said the aircraft was a Boeing 777.</p>
<p>There were no immediate details on the number of passengers on board or on any hijack demands.</p>
</text>
